5. Peer Comment
Peer feedback: "Step 2 only says 'click the plus' — I had to search for where the new-repository control actually is, because there is no button literally labeled 'plus'. Walking me through + menu → New repository and bolding the on-screen labels would let a first-time user follow without guessing. Also, 'hit create' reads informal; 'select Create repository' feels more like a manual."

6. Result Check
Result check: After completing Step 6, the repository page must open and display the README below the file list. If the README does not appear, refresh the page and confirm that the Add a README file checkbox was selected in Step 5 before retrying Step 6.
